Like, Donkey Kong games in the style of the arcade version, we'll never see that again, I think.

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:40.680
No. I don't think we'll ever see any more levels of that idea expanded upon.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:44.240
The closest we'll ever get is the way Super Mario Odyssey handled it.

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:46.120
And that's really not enough.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:47.540
It's just a nostalgic kick.

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:49.060
It's just like a nice, like, hey, did you notice?

00:14:49.140 --> 00:14:50.180
Remember? That's the thing.

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:51.200
Do you remember this? Yeah.

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:55.320
So, Donkey Kong Country is the way things will be going for Donkey Kong going forward.

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:58.040
I'm just happy to have Donkey Kong in our lives.

00:14:58.180 --> 00:14:59.560
Yeah. But Donkey Kong's cool.

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:04.040
And that this sad time in history would end.

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:08.200
I would like to see Donkey Kong be as big as he was in Donkey Kong.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:10.040
Like, for size, I'm talking about.

00:15:10.120 --> 00:15:11.000
Like, scale. Yeah.

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:12.300
He was massive. He was.

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:14.980
If you look at it. Now he's, like, the same size as Mario, kind of.

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:18.560
Like, maybe a little bigger, but, like, a little more muscular, no doubt.

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:20.440
But, like, size-wise, they're about totally...

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:23.540
So, I think, yeah, Nintendo, if you're listening, Donkey Kong, but bigger.

00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:26.000
Donkey Kong, but bigger. And in Smash.

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.320
Donkey Kong's in Smash.

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:33.340
That was a joke because in Donkey Kong Jr., they said that he was too big to be the title character.

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:35.920
It's a callback. You should watch the other episode.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.220
Listen to it. You can't watch it.

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:41.740
So, let's do the Essential Games list.

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:46.960
All right. It's the Essential Games list.

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:48.580
You got your PS4.

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:49.660
You got your PC.

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:50.700
Nintendo Switch.

